<title>USA: Dominion Resources unit files for shelf offer.</title>
<headline>Dominion Resources unit files for shelf offer.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-01-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Virginia Electric &amp; Power Co., a subsidiary of Dominion Resources Inc, filed with the Securities and Exchange Commission on Tuesday for a shelf offering of up to $400 million of junior subordinated debentures.</p>
<p>The company said it will use proceeds from the sale to redeem or repay certain securities it previously issued and for related costs or for corporate capital requirements.</p>
<p>The company did not name underwriters for the sale.</p>
</text>
